  "description": "Luxury, Power, Speed, and Range for Miles of Smiles!\nThe E-Lux Tahoe Stepthru GT in our Flagship Line blends the best E-Lux has to offer in Luxury, Power, Speed, and Range with an extra large frame and ultra-comfortable upright riding position we’re famous for bringing you “Miles of Smiles” as you blast down the path!\nExperience Ultimate Luxury with a RST Front Shock, NCX Suspension Seat Post, Serfas Gel Seat, and Ultra Quiet Tires as you glide down the road.\nUltimate Power is at your thumb tip with our 48 Volt 750 Watt (1375 Peak Watt) Dapu Motor and Samsung/Panasonic Battery drive train. Hills? No Problem. Wind? No Problem. Just push the throttle and the Tahoe Stepthru GT takes off hard!\nUltimate Speed is yours! With a top speed of 28 mph the Tahoe Stepthru GT will get you there fast when needed! Just engage the Pedal Assist and you’re on your way. And with all that speed Ultimate Braking is a must. The Tahoe Stepthru GT is outfitted with top of the line Tektro Auriga E-Comp Hydraulic Brakes delivering incredible stopping power and control at the tip of your fingers. And for Lighting we’ve also added an integrated headlight, taillight, and active rear brake light increasing visibility and safety both daytime and night!\nUltimate Range – The Tahoe Stepthru GT’s drive train is powered by a Dapu Motor and a Samsung/Panasonic 48 Volt 21ah Battery boasting a massive range of 60-70 miles! And being equipped with the 3 Level Power Adjust feature; you can control how hard the bike accelerates – adding extra power when you want or increasing range an additional 25-30% by dropping into “Eco” mode.\nGet on a Tahoe Stepthru GT today and experience what E-lux is all about… E-Luxury!\n\nIf your color is not available please call to check backorder availability.\nELUX_TSTGT",
